msgid "**System Admin Reconcile:** [files/python/rbac_sync.py](./files/python/rbac_sync.py) grants `system_admin` to the members of the `administrator` role group and revokes it from every other human account except the platform administrator, through `mmctl --local roles`. It runs as a host hook of [sys-ctl-mtn-rbac-sync](../sys-ctl-mtn-rbac-sync/) at every deploy and on its timer, so a member who has not signed in yet gets the role on the first run after the first sign-in."
msgstr ""

msgid "**System Admin Reconcile:** `files/python/rbac_sync.py <./files/python/rbac_sync.py>`__ grants ``system_admin`` to the members of the ``administrator`` role group and revokes it from every other human account except the platform administrator, through ``mmctl --local roles``. It runs as a host hook of `sys-ctl-mtn-rbac-sync <../sys-ctl-mtn-rbac-sync/>`__ at every deploy and on its timer, so a member who has not signed in yet gets the role on the first run after the first sign-in."
msgstr ""

