msgid "**Tor and direct lists:** ``egress.tor`` and ``egress.direct`` each carry an ``include`` and an ``except``; entries are host names, ``*.`` wildcards, IPs and CIDRs. A host name covers its subdomains, so ``example.org`` and ``*.example.org`` mean the same. ``except`` only narrows its own ``include``, a destination both lists keep takes Tor, and the route decides everything no list matches. ``.onion`` can never be direct."
