msgstr "**``images/``** NFS үчүн тандоо (``nfs: true`` менен ``compose_volumes`` чалуудан ``templates/compose.yml.j2``). Бул көлөм бардык топтордун түйүндөрүнө бөлүштүрүлөт, ошондуктан MediaWiki Өтүнмө берүү кызматы эркин түрдө пландаштырылышы мүмкүн."

msgid "**``ldap``:** ``enable-login-with-ldap``, the “LDAP” button on the login form that binds against ```svc-db-openldap`` <../svc-db-openldap/>`__. Under SSO it is off and LDAP accounts sign in through the Keycloak federation."
msgstr ""

msgid "**``local.sh`` — fully local, no external GitHub.** Checks the runner containers are healthy and the DooD socket works, then ``container cp``\\ s the repo into a runner, **builds the Infinito image locally**, and deploys ``web-app-dashboard`` (all other services disabled) inside a **sealed, throwaway Docker daemon** that shares the runner’s network namespace. The sandbox is torn down on exit, so the host stack is never touched and **no GitHub/GHCR access is required**. On the update pass the heavy deploy is skipped (it is validated once on the first pass)."
msgstr ""

msgid "**``native``:** ``enable-login-with-password`` or ``disable-login-with-password``. Penpot keeps the email and password fields for the LDAP button, but without this flag no local password signs in. When it is on, ``tasks/main.yml`` bootstraps a local password for the ``administrator`` profile through the backend PREPL (``create-profile`` for a fresh profile, ``update-profile`` when a federated login already created it)."
msgstr ""

msgid "**``proxy_rdns`` is on.** A ``.onion`` has no DNS entry, so Tor must resolve it — the name is never resolved locally."
msgstr ""

msgid "**``registration``:** ``enable-registration`` or ``disable-registration``, the local “Create an account” path. Penpot accepts a local sign-up only while ``native`` is on as well."
msgstr ""

msgid "**``sso``:** ``enable-login-with-oidc`` (the in-app “OpenID” entry to ```web-app-keycloak`` <../web-app-keycloak/>`__) together with ``enable-oidc-registration``, so a first OIDC login creates its Penpot profile while local self-registration stays closed."
msgstr ""

