# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "In embedded mode (``shared: false``) a consumer’s compose stack receives a storage-only SeaweedFS container without UI or published ports. The embedded S3 listener performs no authentication, so it MUST stay confined to the consumer’s isolated compose network."
msgstr "Инсталляцияланган режимде (``shared: false``) керектөөчүнүн композиттик стектери гана сакталат SeaweedFS UI же жарыяланган портторсуз контейнер. Киргизилген S3 Угуучу аутентификацияны жүргүзбөйт, ошондуктан ал керектөөчүнүн обочолонуп калган композициялык тармагына гана чектелиши керек."

msgid "In embedded mode (``shared: false``) a consumer’s compose stack receives a storage-only SeaweedFS container without UI or published ports. The embedded S3 listener starts without identities and accepts unauthenticated requests until the background ``s3.configure`` grant at startup registers the consumer identity; from then on it authenticates against that identity. Embedded buckets carry no ``DenyAnonymousRead`` statement because the listener publishes no port, so the container MUST stay confined to the consumer’s isolated compose network."
msgstr ""

