msgid "Runs as a manager-pinned stateful service (``service_is_stateful: true``) on the swarm manager. Custom images built on the manager via ``compose build`` are tagged and pushed to this registry; workers pull from it on ``docker stack deploy`` and on reschedule, removing the need for out-of-band ``docker save | docker load`` distribution."
