msgid "The role directory name is the `application_id`. For example `roles/web-app-mailu/meta/services.yml` is exposed as `applications['web-app-mailu'].services`, `roles/web-app-mailu/meta/server.yml` as `applications['web-app-mailu'].server`, and so on."
msgstr "Роль каталогунун аталышы `application_id`. Мисалы. `roles/web-app-mailu/meta/services.yml` ачык-айкын `applications['web-app-mailu'].services`, `roles/web-app-mailu/meta/server.yml` катары катары `applications['web-app-mailu'].server`, жана башкалар."

