msgid "The role ensures that Docker and Docker Compose are present, integrates essential backup, repair, and health check roles, and supports cleanup or full reset modes for a fresh Docker environment.   When enabled via `CLEANUP` or `RESET`, it will automatically prune unused Docker resources.   `RESET` additionally restarts the Docker service after cleanup."
