msgid "The three stack roles already have a `meta/services.yml` (`backend`, `full`, `front-proxy`), but none is a provider. `required_by` only feeds the coverage lint and the post-deploy verifier (`cli/meta/roles/services/called/__init__.py`), it loads nothing."
