msgid "This README file is for the Java role, which is part of the ``infinito``. The role is specifically designed to automate the installation of Java on a system, focusing on the OpenJDK 11 version."
msgstr "Бул README файлы Java роль, анын бир бөлүгү ``infinito``. Бул рол атайын орнотууну автоматташтыруу үчүн иштелип чыккан. Java OpenJDK системасына басым жасоо 11 версиясы."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This README file is for the Java role, which is part of the `infinito`. The role is specifically designed to automate the installation of Java on a system, focusing on the OpenJDK 11 version."
