msgid "Under `all` dnsmasq drops to `user=dnsmasq`, and the deploy requires that user. Upstream DNS for direct names is admitted only for the effective UID of the running dnsmasq, read from `/proc/<MainPID>/status`. The deploy refuses that UID when it is 0 or 65534 or when processes other than dnsmasq run as it, because the admission would cover them too."
